{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a good ol' game of dice!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_dice3.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diecast </strong> is a roguelike based on the classic dice game &quot;yacht dice&quot;. Roll <strong>crazy combinations of dice </strong>to reach <strong>increasingly outrageous scores</strong>. Roll and reroll your dice to make a scoring hand to <strong>win each round</strong>. Use the money you win to buy new dice\u00a0with <strong>unique abilities and faces</strong>, increasing your options. Or, <strong>buy new scoring hands\u00a0</strong>and <strong>powerful items</strong> that can <strong>change your strategy in drastic ways</strong>. But with each completed round the score needed to win increases, and the stakes are raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_hands.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge yourself </strong>in boss rounds that have unique quirks that can change your approach. Find new combinations of dice, scoring hands, and items during each run to help you roll your way to victory <strong>or beyond</strong>! Unlock and try out different sets of starting dice that provide <strong>further challenges and strategies </strong>to what you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_items.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 64 dice with special abilities, variations, and classes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over two-dozen upgradable hands with unique rules for scoring</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 40 items to add further possibilities to your run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Endless possibility for strategy and fun, designed around 30+ minute runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Again, welcome to a good ol' game of dice! I hope you enjoy the show!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2443590?t=1743305365","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743305365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/c28e87371fab412fd5dd54e26cb72eb483ac0d83/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743305365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/c28e87371fab412fd5dd54e26cb72eb483ac0d83/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743305365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to a good ol' game of dice!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_dice3.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Diecast </strong> is a roguelike based on the classic dice game &quot;yacht dice&quot;. Roll <strong>crazy combinations of dice </strong>to reach <strong>increasingly outrageous scores</strong>. Roll and reroll your dice to make a scoring hand to <strong>win each round</strong>. Use the money you win to buy new dice\u00a0with <strong>unique abilities and faces</strong>, increasing your options. Or, <strong>buy new scoring hands\u00a0</strong>and <strong>powerful items</strong> that can <strong>change your strategy in drastic ways</strong>. But with each completed round the score needed to win increases, and the stakes are raised.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_hands.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge yourself </strong>in boss rounds that have unique quirks that can change your approach. Find new combinations of dice, scoring hands, and items during each run to help you roll your way to victory <strong>or beyond</strong>! Unlock and try out different sets of starting dice that provide <strong>further challenges and strategies </strong>to what you can do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/extras/steam_description_items.gif?t=1743305365\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 64 dice with special abilities, variations, and classes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over two-dozen upgradable hands with unique rules for scoring</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 40 items to add further possibilities to your run</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Endless possibility for strategy and fun, designed around 30+ minute runs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Again, welcome to a good ol' game of dice! I hope you enjoy the show!</p>","developers":["sofamire"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443590/header.jpg?t=1743305365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true